4838 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The Chain Reaction field features automations and auto\055scoring features that interact with the game at various points\056\n\nThe Accelerator features an auto\055score and reject system that counts scored particles and launches them back onto the field\056 This feature is used to randomize the field pre\055match after robots are initialized by randomly distributing all 300 particles across the playing area\056\n\nThis automation also runs throughout the Driver Controlled period\054 ensuring that particles are re\055distributed onto the field as they are scored\056\n\nThe Hooks also feature their own auto\055score system that confirms the Catalyst has been successfully placed and ensure that the scoring bonus to Particles is applied correctly\056)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 4839 0 R
     /Pg 1703 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

